            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f2" n="2" xml:id="d138-f2-content">
                <p>A memorandum of Dulles’ conversation with Governor General Sir Oliver
                    Goonetilleke on March 11 is <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.,</hi> Central File
                    110.11–DU/3–2256.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f3" n="3" xml:id="d138-f3-content">
                <p>Secretary Dulles’ visit to Ceylon was briefly discussed at a meeting of
                    representatives of the Department of State and the Joint Chiefs of Staff on
                    March 30 as part of a general discussion of the Secretary’s post-SEATO trip.
                    (Memorandum on the substance of discussions at a Department of State–Joint
                    Chiefs of Staff meeting, March 30; <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.,</hi> State–JCS
                    Meetings: Lot 61 D 417)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
